   <media:description>The King of Reggaeton, @DaddyYankee is opening his YouTube Watch History for the very first time! 

Ahead of his new album “LA POSTAL” (dropping October 30), global superstar and Puerto Rican icon Daddy Yankee gave us free rein to scroll through his Watch History, offering an exclusive, unfiltered look at what he watches on YouTube. From hilarious fail compilations to his favorite song of all time to Carl Jung’s psychoanalysis, Daddy Yankee takes us through the unexpected videos that inspire and entertain the legend himself. 

It’s time to see the many different sides of Daddy Yankee! 

